//     no operation is started.
//     State-dependent, so 409 and not 422: the SAME request succeeds
//     once the contract authorises the type.
//     A separate code rather than a reuse of E020017: E020017's meaning
//     is "no contract for this account", which is false for an account
//     that holds one contract and names another. Not E020016 either:
//     releasing a resource never makes a contract authorise a type,
